   "text": "GBSB Global Business School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nGBSB Global Business School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nGBSB Global Business School is a fully accredited private educational institution in Spain and Malta that teaches business in English at undergraduate and graduate levels and is dedicated to preparing students for the careers of the global economy. GBSB Global has a strong focus on innovation and technology, both in our online and on-campus programs. We are within a few business schools in Europe to offer a fully digitalized experience to our students throughout the learning process; this includes digital touch boards in all classrooms, collaborative apps, inclusive learning environment, and various educational digital tools.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n14/07/2026 09:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n17/05/2023 10:29\nby Data Migration\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSpain\nYearly Fees\nMax: €18,000.00\nMin: €9,900.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n75%\n375 of 500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2010\nCampus(es)\nBarcelona, Malta\nCountry\nSpain\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/06/2026\nContract End Date\n16/07/2027\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.global-business-school.org/info/about-school/accommodation-services\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.global-business-school.org/info/program_description/business-bachelor-malta\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DwRi8lpAnDA\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.global-business-school.org/career-services\nAdditional Information\n-",
